# Walkthrough: Unified Real-Time SSE Log Streaming & Thread Management

We have successfully migrated the request handling architecture from a separate WebSocket protocol to a **unified, modern Server-Sent Events (SSE) stream** on the `/request` endpoint!

---

## 🌟 Modern SSE Stream Design

The endpoint `POST /request` now handles the entire workflow of executing agents and logging inside a **single HTTP connection** using LangGraph's async updates stream (`graph.astream`):

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Android Chat UI (Client)
    participant API as FastAPI Backend (Server)
    participant LangGraph as LangGraph Agent Workflow

    App->>API: POST /request (User message)
    activate API
    API->>LangGraph: astream(input_state)
    
    loop Real-time Agent Updates
        LangGraph-->>API: yield updates
        API-->>App: data: {"type": "agent_start", "agent": "...", "message": "..."}
        API-->>App: data: {"type": "log", "agent": "...", "message": "..."}
    end

    LangGraph-->>API: returns final state (or Interrupted)
    API-->>App: data: {"type": "done", "task_id": "...", "status": "...", "assistant_message": "..."}
    deactivate API
    Note over App,API: SSE Connection Closes
```

### Event Payload Formats

As the connection remains open, the mobile client receives three highly structured event types:

1. **`agent_start` Event:** Indicates which agent (e.g. `IntentAgent`, `DiscoveryAgent`, `RankingAgent`) is currently executing.
   ```json
   {
     "type": "agent_start",
     "agent": "IntentAgent",
     "message": "IntentAgent is running..."
   }
   ```
2. **`log` Event:** Real-time log entries printed by the active agent.
   ```json
   {
     "type": "log",
     "agent": "DiscoveryAgent",
     "message": "Searching for 'AC Technician' in 'G-13'"
   }
   ```
3. **`done` Event:** Fired at the end of the step. Carries the final answer or clarification request, status, and full state dump.
   ```json
   {
     "type": "done",
     "task_id": "8b9e6f30-84c4-42b7-a36c-2f96cfb2fb2b",
     "status": "awaiting_confirmation",
     "assistant_message": "I found Ali AC Services for 1500.0 PKR. Do you want me to book this for you? (Yes/No)",
     "full_state": { ... }
   }
   ```

