## 🛠️ Verification & API usage

### 1. Send Request & Monitor real-time logs:
```powershell
Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Uri "http://127.0.0.1:8000/request" -ContentType "application/json" -Body '{"text": "AC repair in G-13 tomorrow at 10 AM", "user_id": "test_user_1"}'
```
*Client streams the initial parsing logs and finishes with the selection done payload.*

### 2. Retrieve threads listing:
```powershell
Invoke-RestMethod -Method Get -Uri "http://127.0.0.1:8000/threads/test_user_1"
```
*Returns `[{"thread_id": "...", "title": "AC repair in G-13", "created_at": "..."}]`*

### 3. Get message history for the thread:
```powershell
Invoke-RestMethod -Method Get -Uri "http://127.0.0.1:8000/threads/YOUR_THREAD_ID/messages"
```
*Returns clean array of message turns suitable for mobile UI rendering.*

### 4. Retrieve bookings listing:
```powershell
Invoke-RestMethod -Method Get -Uri "http://127.0.0.1:8000/bookings/test_user_1"
```
*Returns full confirmation statuses joined with real provider information.*
